OL,3,GNEWSANew bus stop installed in village
OL,4,Awith no bus services
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have renewed calls for a bus
OL,7,Fservice in their village after a new
OL,8,Fstop was installed despite no buses
OL,9,Frunning for almost 10 years.
OL,11,FPeople in Egginton, Derbyshire, said
OL,12,Fthey felt cut off after the hourly V2
OL,13,FVillager was withdrawn in 2017, forcing
OL,14,Fpeople to travel in cars or taxis to
OL,15,Faccess services in nearby towns and
OL,16,Fvillages.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
