OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANew bus stop installed in village
OL,4,Awith no bus services
OL,5,
OL,6,FKathryn Bishop, 77, who had reported
OL,7,Fthe previous stop was damaged, said:
OL,8,F"It was humorous at first. But I
OL,9,Fcouldn't believe it when I looked out
OL,10,Fof the window a couple of days later to
OL,11,Fsee the new one being put up."
OL,13,FThe East Midlands Combined County
OL,14,FAuthority said the stop in Main Street
OL,15,Fwas installed in case services returned
OL,16,Fin the future.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
